1
00:00:02,090 --> 00:00:05,850
Your own watchlists appear as tabs under the categories.

2
00:00:05,950 --> 00:00:08,570
Right-click a tab to move, rename or delete it.

3
00:00:08,670 --> 00:00:12,540
Move Left and Move Right change the order of your tabs.

4
00:00:12,640 --> 00:00:17,810
Majors now comes after Metals.

5
00:00:17,910 --> 00:00:22,980
Choose Rename to give a tab a new name.

6
00:00:23,080 --> 00:00:26,820
Type the new name and click Save.

7
00:00:26,920 --> 00:00:32,600
The tab shows its new name. The instruments in it stay the same.

8
00:00:32,700 --> 00:00:36,120
Delete Watchlist removes a tab you no longer need.

9
00:00:36,220 --> 00:00:41,230
You are asked to confirm first. Deleting cannot be undone.

10
00:00:41,330 --> 00:00:44,730
The watchlist is gone. Your other lists are not affected.

